-card" href="/poetry"><span class="subject-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.7 3.3c-4.6-.6-9.1 1.6-11.9 5.6L5 15.5 3 21l1.4.4 2-4.9h4.1c4.4-1.6 8-5.7 9.8-11.4l.4-1.8zM9.4 14.5H7.6l2.8-4.5c1.7-2.4 4.1-4.1 6.8-4.6-1.5 3.8-4.4 7.1-7.8 9.1z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="subject-card__name">Poetry</span><span class="subject-card__hook">Rhythms of the soul — short, personal, human.</span></a></li><li><a class="subject-card" href="/music"><span class="subject-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v10.6A4 4 0 1 0 14 17V7h5V3h-7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="subject-card__name">Music</span><span class="subject-card__hook">Poems set to song on his YouTube channel.</span></a></li><li><a class="subject-card" href="/art"><span class="subject-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.7 2.3a1 1 0 0 0-1.4 0L9.5 12.1l2.4 2.4 9.8-9.8a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4l-1-1zM7.5 14a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.5 3.5c0 1.3-1 2-2 2 1 1.5 3 2.5 5 2.5a4 4 0 0 0 4-4 3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.5-4z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="subject-card__name">Art</span><span class="subject-card__hook">Digital painting with the Paintology app.</span></a></li></ul>		<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="785" class="elementor elementor-785" data-elementor-post-type="page">
